title: heralds could show path* lengths
pid: d3d4945c-3e28-474b-9b9b-87592b1d4b69
body: |2-
    * path or "path to nearest fork plus the first layer of the fork"

  A single scalar for
        the maximum {length, number of forks} in the path
    and whehther the path cycles.
  If its container is its unique org-parent,
    no glyph shown.
flags:
- Had_ID_Before_Import
